      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Raposa. Quando é atacado por um inimigo mais forte, Vulpix finge estar ferido para enganá-lo e escapar. À medida que seu corpo cresce, suas seis caudas quentes ficam ainda mais bonitas, cobertas por uma pelagem cada vez mais luxuosa.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 25% M / 75% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Vulpix pode evoluir para Ninetales no nível 6 ou superior com a ajuda de uma Fire Stone. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Ember</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Disable, Tail Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Baby-Doll Eyes, Roar</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Confuse Ray, Quick Attack, Spite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Fire Spin</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Incinerate, Payback</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Will-O-Wisp</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Feint Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Hex</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Flame Burst</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Extrasensory</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Flamethrower, Safeguard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Imprison</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Fire Blast</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Captivate, Grudge, Inferno</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Agility, Attract, Baby-Doll Eyes, Baton Pass, Body Slam, Burning Jealousy, Charm, Confide, Confuse Ray, Covet, Dark Pulse, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Encore, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Fire Blast, Fire Spin, Flame Charge, Flamethrower, Flare Blitz, Foul Play, Frustration, Heat Wave, Helping Hand, Hex, Hidden Power, Imprison, Iron Tail, Mystical Fire, Nasty Plot, Ominous Wind, Overheat, Pain Split, Payback, Power Swap, Protect, Psych Up, Rest, Return, Roar, Role Play, Round, Safeguard, Sleep Talk, Snarl, Snore, Spite, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Tail Slap, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Weather Ball, Will- O-Wisp, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Baby-Doll Eyes, Captivate, Disable, Extrasensory, Feint Attack, Flail, Flame Charge, Flare Blitz, Healing Wish, Heat Wave, Hex, Howl, Hypnosis, Memento, Power Swap, Roar, Secret Power, Spite, Tail Slap</p>",
